Implements a comprehensive marketplace engine for GnuCash integrating concepts from Shopify marketplaces (merchant/buyer operations), Virtunomics (business simulation), and the existing OpenCog cognitive framework (AI-powered intelligence).

## Core Implementation

- **MarketplaceEngine** (`libgnucash/marketplace/`) - C++17 API with manager pattern
  - ProductManager: catalog, variants, images, categories
  - OrderManager: checkout, payment, status tracking
  - InventoryManager: stock levels, alerts, reordering
  - CustomerManager: profiles, addresses, order history
  - StorefrontManager: multi-tenant stores, branding, business config

## Key Features

**E-Commerce Operations**
- Product catalog with search, filtering, pagination
- Multi-item orders with 6 payment methods, 6 shipping options
- Real-time inventory tracking with low-stock alerts
- Customer profiles with order history

**AI Integration** (OpenCog cognitive engine)
- Product recommendations based on purchase patterns
- Dynamic pricing using market data
- Demand forecasting and fraud detection hooks
- Pattern matching for customer behavior analysis

**Business Simulation** (Virtunomics-inspired)
- Multi-entity business management structures
- Supply chain tracking with supplier relationships
- Economic modeling framework with market dynamics
- Business analytics and KPIs

**Architecture**
- Event-driven callbacks for webhooks/notifications
- Thread-safe operations with clean separation of concerns
- In-memory storage with interfaces ready for database backends
- GnuCash accounting integration via transaction creation hooks

## Usage

```cpp
#include <libgnucash/marketplace/marketplace_engine.hpp>

auto& engine = gnc::marketplace::marketplace_engine();
engine.initialize();

// Create storefront
StorefrontInfo store;
store.seller_id = "SELLER-001";
store.name = "Tech Store";
auto store_id = engine.save_storefront(store);

// Add product with inventory
ProductInfo product;
product.name = "Laptop";
product.base_price = 999.99;
product.stock_quantity = 50;
auto product_id = engine.create_product(product);

// Process order
OrderInfo order;
order.customer_id = "CUST-001";
order.items.push_back({product_id, 1, 999.99});
auto order_id = engine.create_order(order);
engine.process_payment(order_id, PaymentMethod::CREDIT_CARD, "TXN-001");

// AI-powered features
auto recommendations = engine.get_recommendations("CUST-001", 10);
double optimal_price = engine.suggest_price(product_id, market_data);

// Event subscriptions
engine.subscribe_events([](auto type, auto data) {
    if (type == "order.created") { /* handle event */ }
});
```

## Testing & Documentation

- 10 unit tests covering all manager operations (gtest-marketplace.cpp)
- Working demo application showing complete workflow
- API reference (16KB), integration guide (14KB), module overview (8KB)
- CMake integration with proper dependency linking

## Files Added (25)

Core: marketplace_engine.{hpp,cpp}, marketplace_types.hpp, {product,order,inventory,customer,storefront}.{hpp,cpp}  
Tests: test/gtest-marketplace.cpp, test/CMakeLists.txt  
Examples: examples/marketplace_demo.cpp, examples/CMakeLists.txt  
Docs: README.md, API.md, INTEGRATION.md, MARKETPLACE.md

~2,600 LOC total. No breaking changes to existing GnuCash code.

