## Bug 1: NPC Spell School Categories Not Collapsible
**Issue**: Spell school dropdowns in NPC sheets do not fold up/down when clicked.

**Root Cause**: NPC sheet likely missing the same collapse/expand handlers that were added to PC sheet.

**Files to Fix**:
- `module/sheets/npc-sheet.js` - Add spell school collapse handlers in `activateListeners()` and `_applyCollapsedGroups()`

**Implementation**:
```javascript
// In activateListeners() - add spell school collapse handlers
html.find('.spell-school-header').on('click', (ev) => {
  ev.preventDefault();
  const header = ev.currentTarget;
  const section = header.closest('.spell-school-section');
  const table = section.querySelector('.spell-school-table');
  const arrow = header.querySelector('.collapse-arrow');
  const groupKey = header.dataset.group;

  if (!table || !arrow) return;

  const isCollapsed = table.style.display === 'none';
  table.style.display = isCollapsed ? '' : 'none';
  arrow.classList.toggle('fa-chevron-down', isCollapsed);
  arrow.classList.toggle('fa-chevron-right', !isCollapsed);

  // Save state
  const collapsedGroups = this.actor.getFlag('uesrpg-3ev4', 'collapsedGroups') || {};
  collapsedGroups[groupKey] = !isCollapsed;
  this.actor.setFlag('uesrpg-3ev4', 'collapsedGroups', collapsedGroups);
});

// In _applyCollapsedGroups() - apply spell school collapsed states
const spellSchoolSections = html.find('.spell-school-section');
spellSchoolSections.each((i, section) => {
  const header = section.querySelector('.spell-school-header');
  const groupKey = header?.dataset?.group;
  if (!groupKey) return;

  const isCollapsed = Boolean(collapsedGroups[groupKey]);
  const table = section.querySelector('.spell-school-table');
  const arrow = header.querySelector('.collapse-arrow');

  if (table) table.style.display = isCollapsed ? 'none' : '';
  if (arrow) {
    arrow.classList.toggle('fa-chevron-down', !isCollapsed);
    arrow.classList.toggle('fa-chevron-right', isCollapsed);
  }
});
```

